    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d233">

                <pb facs="0342" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg222"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-08-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 29, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 77.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a
                    translation of a note which I received on the 26th instant from Prince Ch’ing
                    regarding the attitude of the Chinese Government in re its responsibility for
                    the boycott in reply to three notes which I had addressed to him on the 7th and
                    14th instants, copies of which I sent you in my dispatch No. 60, of the 17th
                    instant.</p>
                <p>I also inclose copy of the note which I sent Prince Ch’ing under date of the 27th
                    instant in reply to his.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d233-a1.xml" xpointer="d233-a1"/>
